From: Erich Seifert <dev@erichseifert.de>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:34:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Test relinking through the PostProject sidecar

Cover a renamed clip, a clip outside the project folder, a relink
recorded on the next save with its former location retired or kept,
Kdenlive's hash kept without roots or pending representations, several
clips answered from one resolution, two identical copies, a candidate
rejected by Kdenlive's hash, and a missing or unreadable sidecar.

